WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.711 --> 00:00:02.851
- [Voiceover] Are you a hot mess mom?

00:00:02.851 --> 00:00:04.610
Do you have a hard time keeping your

00:00:04.610 --> 00:00:05.050
(beep)

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:05.991
together?

00:00:05.991 --> 00:00:07.750
Well, you're in luck.

00:00:07.750 --> 00:00:09.070
We have some brilliant solutions

00:00:09.070 --> 00:00:10.711
to help you hack your way through life.

00:00:10.711 --> 00:00:14.065
(upbeat music)

00:00:16.495 --> 00:00:18.014
Wear leggings and t-shirts to bed

00:00:18.014 --> 00:00:20.605
so you don't have to change in the AM.

00:00:20.605 --> 00:00:23.284
You're ready for the school run.

00:00:23.284 --> 00:00:24.745
Multitasking is your friend.

00:00:24.745 --> 00:00:26.584
Brush your teeth and check social media

00:00:26.584 --> 00:00:28.164
while on the toilet.

00:00:28.164 --> 00:00:30.960
Eat off of paper towels so you
don't have to do the dishes.

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.980
Doubles as a napkin.

00:00:33.980 --> 00:00:35.940
Eat while you breastfeed,

00:00:35.940 --> 00:00:37.531
don't worry about those crumbs.

00:00:38.440 --> 00:00:40.501
Yep, you can use that to wipe your hands.

00:00:40.501 --> 00:00:41.786
Sure.

00:00:41.786 --> 00:00:42.573
Kids waking you up at the

00:00:42.573 --> 00:00:43.133
(beep)

00:00:43.133 --> 00:00:44.293
crack of dawn?

00:00:44.293 --> 00:00:45.690
Go for it.

00:00:45.690 --> 00:00:46.931
Haven't you forgotten something?

00:00:46.931 --> 00:00:48.250
Deodorant?

00:00:48.250 --> 00:00:50.610
It's okay, baby wipes will do.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:53.270
Oh, and they'll also wipe
off that stain right there.

00:00:53.270 --> 00:00:54.750
You didn't wash your face?

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:57.040
Baby wipes for that too.

00:00:58.131 --> 00:00:59.730
Who has time for baking?

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:00.630
Not you.

00:01:00.630 --> 00:01:01.770
Buy store bought cupcakes

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:05.171
and smear the frosting
around to look home baked.

00:01:05.171 --> 00:01:05.774
(beep)

00:01:05.774 --> 00:01:08.830
Forgot to shave your legs,
keep a razor in your car.

00:01:08.830 --> 00:01:11.024
- Ah, this kind of hurts.

00:01:11.024 --> 00:01:11.805
- [Voiceover] Well then
you should have got you

00:01:11.805 --> 00:01:12.284
(beep)

00:01:12.284 --> 00:01:13.184
together and taken a shower.

00:01:13.184 --> 00:01:15.644
- Nope, never mind, it
doesn't hurt that bad.

00:01:15.644 --> 00:01:17.024
- [Voiceover] Share day always creeps up

00:01:17.024 --> 00:01:18.584
at an unexpected moment,

00:01:18.584 --> 00:01:20.971
so keep toys in your purse at all times.

00:01:20.971 --> 00:01:22.212
You've had a long day,

00:01:22.212 --> 00:01:23.892
assign the boring books to your partner.

00:01:23.892 --> 00:01:25.852
- Oh honey, give it to Daddy.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.951
He loves these really long stories.

00:01:27.951 --> 00:01:29.531
Now you're ready to take on the world,

00:01:29.531 --> 00:01:30.671
and time manage the

00:01:30.671 --> 00:01:31.051
(beep)

00:01:31.051 --> 00:01:32.111
out of your life.

00:01:32.111 --> 00:01:33.631
Go forth and conquer.

00:01:33.631 --> 00:01:38.631
(upbeat music)

